---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Offre anniversaire terminée | Le Musicien"
  description="L'offre éclair de Vince pour ses 42 ans est terminée. Découvre le Pass MAO pour continuer à créer, produire et mixer ta musique."
  pageClass="birthday-closed-page"
  noindex={true}
  image="/images/pass/pass-mao-visuel.png"
  hideHeader={true}
>
  <div class="b42">
    <header class="b42-nav">
      <div class="b42-wrap b42-nav-inner">
        <a href="/" class="b42-brand" aria-label="Le Musicien, accueil">LE MUSICIEN <span>par Vince</span></a>
        <a href="/formations/" class="b42-nav-link">Toutes les formations <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main class="b42-main b42-wrap">
      <div class="b42-label"><span aria-hidden="true">●</span> L'OFFRE ANNIVERSAIRE EST TERMINÉE</div>
      <div class="b42-hero">
        <div class="b42-hero-copy">
          <p class="b42-eyebrow">42 ans, une offre éclair… et puis s'en va.</p>
          <h1>Tu as raté<br /><em>l'offre !</em> <span aria-label="Un gâteau d'anniversaire">🎂</span></h1>
          <p class="b42-lead">Pour mes 42 ans, j'avais proposé <strong>une formation au choix pour 42 €</strong>. Mais c'était une offre de 24 heures, et les 24 heures sont passées.</p>
          <p>Merci à ceux qui en ont profité, vous m'avez fait un joli cadeau d'anniversaire ! 😁</p>
          <p>Pour les autres, il reste plein de façons de faire avancer votre musique. Pas besoin d'attendre que j'aie 43 ans.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="b42-stamp" aria-label="Offre à 42 euros terminée">
          <span class="b42-stamp-top">ÉDITION ANNIVERSAIRE</span>
          <div class="b42-stamp-price">42<sup>€</sup></div>
          <div class="b42-stamp-closed">C'EST TERMINÉ</div>
          <p>21 - 22 novembre 2026</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <section class="b42-pass" aria-labelledby="b42-pass-title">
        <div class="b42-pass-copy">
          <span class="b42-pass-label">ENVIE DE CONTINUER ?</span>
          <h2 id="b42-pass-title">Une formation, c'est bien.<br /><em>Une bibliothèque entière…</em></h2>
          <p>Avec le <strong>Pass MAO</strong>, tu retrouves une bibliothèque de formations pour composer, produire, mixer et terminer tes morceaux, ainsi que la communauté PM School pour partager, pratiquer et progresser.</p>
          <div class="b42-pass-actions">
            <a class="b42-button" href="/pass-mao/">Découvrir le Pass MAO <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
            <span>Abonnement distinct de l'offre anniversaire</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="b42-pass-image">
          <img
            src="/images/pass/pass-mao-packshot-wide.png"
            alt="Visuel de la bibliothèque de formations du Pass MAO"
            width="700"
            height="366"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
          />
        </div>
      </section>

      <p class="b42-last">Tu préfères choisir une formation à l'unité ? <a href="/formations/">Parcourir le catalogue habituel <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></p>
    </main>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .b42 {
    --b42-bg: #f7f0e4;
    --b42-ink: #231d1a;
    --b42-rust: #c8543c;
    --b42-muted: #685d53;
    --b42-line: #dacbbb;
    background: var(--b42-bg);
    color: var(--b42-ink);
    min-height: calc(100vh - 80px);
    font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif;
  }
  .b42-wrap { width: min(1120px, calc(100% - 44px)); margin-inline: auto; }
  .b42-nav { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--b42-line); }
  .b42-nav-inner { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; min-height: 74px; gap: 15px; }
  .b42-brand { font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: .1em; font-weight: 850; }
  .b42-brand span { font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0; font-weight: 400; padding-left: 5px; }
  .b42-nav-link { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; }
  .b42-nav-link:hover, .b42-last a:hover { color: var(--b42-rust); }
  .b42-main { padding-top: 76px; padding-bottom: 95px; }
  .b42-label { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; border: 1px solid var(--b42-rust); color: var(--b42-rust); padding: 9px 13px; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: .12em; }
  .b42-label span { font-size: 11px; }
  .b42-hero { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.4fr) minmax(260px, .7fr); gap: 64px; align-items: center; padding: 42px 0 78px; }
  .b42-eyebrow { color: var(--b42-rust); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 750; margin-bottom: 18px; }
  .b42-hero h1 { font: 400 clamp(68px, 9.3vw, 122px)/.98 Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif; letter-spacing: -.07em; margin: 0 0 32px; }
  .b42-hero h1 em { color: var(--b42-rust); font-weight: 400; }
  .b42-hero h1 span { font: 400 clamp(35px, 4vw, 50px)/1 system-ui, sans-serif; vertical-align: .15em; letter-spacing: 0; white-space: nowrap; }
  .b42-hero-copy > p:not(.b42-eyebrow) { max-width: 655px; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.75; color: var(--b42-muted); margin-bottom: 15px; }
  .b42-hero-copy .b42-lead { color: var(--b42-ink) !important; font-size: 18px !important; }
  .b42-stamp { background: #fffaf2; border: 2px solid var(--b42-ink); border-radius: 13px; box-shadow: 10px 10px 0 #e5c3ad; padding: 32px 26px 27px; text-align: center; transform: rotate(2deg); }
  .b42-stamp-top { font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: .15em; font-weight: 850; }
  .b42-stamp-price { position: relative; font: 400 clamp(110px, 13vw, 170px)/1 Georgia, serif; letter-spacing: -.1em; margin: 25px 0; opacity: .65; }
  .b42-stamp-price::after { content: ""; position: absolute; left: 7%; right: 7%; top: 48%; transform: rotate(-13deg); height: 7px; border-radius: 10px; background: var(--b42-rust); }
  .b42-stamp-price sup { font: 800 40px Inter, sans-serif; vertical-align: top; position: relative; top: 13px; }
  .b42-stamp-closed { display: inline-block; padding: 9px 15px; background: var(--b42-ink); color: white; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: .09em; font-weight: 850; border-radius: 3px; }
  .b42-stamp > p { margin: 20px 0 0; color: var(--b42-muted); font-size: 12px; }
  .b42-pass { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.2fr .85fr; align-items: center; gap: 36px; padding: 46px 47px; background: #e6d7c3; border: 1px solid #d6c2ab; border-radius: 14px; overflow: hidden; }
  .b42-pass-label { color: var(--b42-rust); font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: .13em; font-weight: 850; }
  .b42-pass h2 { font: 400 clamp(34px, 4.3vw, 53px)/1.12 Georgia, serif; letter-spacing: -.047em; margin: 15px 0 20px; }
  .b42-pass h2 em { font-weight: 400; color: var(--b42-rust); }
  .b42-pass p { font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; color: #5c5046; max-width: 640px; margin-bottom: 23px; }
  .b42-pass-actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 14px; align-items: center; }
  .b42-button { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 20px; padding: 16px 22px; background: var(--b42-ink); color: #fff; border-radius: 5px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 800; transition: background .2s, transform .2s; }
  .b42-button:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); background: #42352c; }
  .b42-pass-actions > span { font-size: 11px; color: #67594d; }
  .b42-pass-image { display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; }
  .b42-pass-image img { width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 370px; object-fit: contain; filter: drop-shadow(0 12px 18px rgba(48, 38, 27, .15)); }
  .b42-last { color: var(--b42-muted); font-size: 13px; text-align: center; margin: 30px 0 0; }
  .b42-last a { color: var(--b42-ink); font-weight: 750; text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 4px; margin-left: 3px; }
  html[data-theme="dark"] .b42 { background: var(--b42-bg); color: var(--b42-ink); }
  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .b42-hero { grid-template-columns: 1fr .75fr; gap: 30px; }
    .b42-hero h1 { font-size: clamp(65px, 9vw, 95px); }
    .b42-pass { grid-template-columns: 1fr .75fr; padding: 32px; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 650px) {
    .b42-wrap { width: min(100% - 36px, 500px); }
    .b42-nav-inner { min-height: 62px; }
    .b42-nav-link { font-size: 11px; }
    .b42-main { padding-top: 40px; padding-bottom: 70px; }
    .b42-hero { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 29px; padding: 30px 0 54px; }
    .b42-hero h1 { font-size: clamp(62px, 13vw, 88px); }
    .b42-hero-copy .b42-lead { font-size: 16px !important; }
    .b42-stamp { max-width: 320px; width: 100%; margin: auto; padding: 19px 25px; box-shadow: 7px 7px 0 #e5c3ad; transform: rotate(1deg); }
    .b42-stamp-price { font-size: 112px; margin: 12px 0; }
    .b42-stamp-price sup { font-size: 30px; }
    .b42-pass { grid-template-columns: 1fr; padding: 27px 22px 15px; gap: 6px; }
    .b42-pass h2 { font-size: 36px; }
    .b42-pass-image img { max-height: 230px; }
    .b42-pass-actions { align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: column; }
    .b42-last { text-align: left; line-height: 1.7; }
  }
</style>
